<Prose title="About All Metal Brake: Who We Are and How We Work" description="All Metal Brake is an independent backup power buying guide. Picks are built on spec sheets and real outage loads, and rankings are never sold." h1="About All Metal Brake" path="/about/" pageType="AboutPage" intro="An independent buying guide for keeping the lights on: home generators, portable power stations, home batteries and the gear that gets you through an outage.">
  <h2>What We Do</h2>
  <p>Most "best generator" lists repeat the box. We start from the spec sheet and do the maths: how many running and starting watts your fridge, furnace and well pump really need, how long a power station's watt-hours last under your loads, what a transfer switch or interlock adds to the bill, and what a standby installation actually costs.</p>
  <p>Today we track <strong>{products.length} products</strong> from <strong>{brands.length} brands</strong> across <strong>{articles.length} in-depth guides</strong>, and we update them as new models arrive and old ones are discontinued.</p>
  <h2>How We're Different</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>We show our working.</strong> Every recommendation names the spec that matters and the calculation behind it.</li>
    <li><strong>Loads first, product second.</strong> The right generator or power station depends on what you need to run and for how long, so our picks say who each one suits.</li>
    <li><strong>We tell you when to skip it.</strong> Every product page has a "skip it if" line, and our brand reviews say where each brand falls short.</li>
    <li><strong>Safety is not optional.</strong> We cover carbon monoxide, safe connection to the house and fuel storage on every page where they apply.</li>
    <li><strong>No paid placements.</strong> Brands cannot pay to be included or ranked. See our <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a>.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>How We Score</h2>
  <p>Every product gets an AMB Score out of 100. Our <a href="/how-we-test/">methodology page</a> explains exactly what goes into it and, just as importantly, what we don't claim.</p>
  <h2>How We Make Money</h2>
  <p>We earn a commission when you buy through some of our links, mainly Amazon, and from display advertising, at no extra cost to you. Commissions never decide rankings. Full details are on our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Spotted an error, or want us to cover a product? Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> or use our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>. We correct factual errors quickly and note material updates on the page.</p>
</Prose>
